{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_flint_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_flint_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"合格的戰士","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_flint_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"aab650e80edb834ee8a7031c90da8b408fcb4deea86874eef37450d3a66eccf3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"燧石透過在王酋的探子面前演戲，暫時穩住了對方，替依娜姆等人爭取了時間。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"打啊！給他一拳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！打他右臉！右臉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，就是這樣！嘿，打這個外頭來的傻大個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"好樣的！讓外頭來的瞧瞧咱們提亞卡烏戰士的厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這打得這麼凶，是有什麼仇啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼仇？管他呢，打完就知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"就是說，不就打一架嘛，有什麼大不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哎老兄，之前沒見過你，新來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對，我就是個四處做點買賣的小商人，今天剛到這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說這片有不少部族，想著能做成生意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！商人！就是那個啥......賣東西的是吧！好啊！咱們這可歡迎賣東西的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不過老兄你別急，有啥好東西，等先看完熱鬧再說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"哎快看！打中了，打中了！漂亮啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"提亞卡烏戰士必勝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就這麼待客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"是你挑釁在先，現在還說什麼待客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，當時是真沒看見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"載具門有點高，我以為你已經上車了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......回頭我會把門改裝成透明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話少說，動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我一定要和你比出個高下，我可是部族最高最強的戰士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"上啊小個子！拿出你當時掀翻我們的氣勢來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"就是說啊小個子！跳起來用你那超級快的拳頭打他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你先收拾他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......少囉嗦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"你空手，我有武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"你贏不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"先說好，我是不會丟掉武器的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你的便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"贏不贏得了，不是你說了算！先問問我的拳頭答不答應！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......野蠻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"出去這麼久，你除了通用語什麼都沒學會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是這裡......這種地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......最適合你這種一根筋的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這小子好像是在誇咱們啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"說的一點都沒錯！只有我們阿卡胡拉才能養出這麼小......但拳頭又這麼大的勇士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？他誇咱們？那、那還打不打了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳，我不覺得這是誇獎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"一群野蠻人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，隨你怎麼說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提亞卡烏戰士的語氣稍顯僵硬，目光掃過周圍的人群。\n她在某個人身上略微停頓了片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的事我記下了，之後再找你算帳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們外頭來的這麼看不起我們提亞卡烏戰士，就早點離開阿卡胡拉的土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你們一群野蠻人扎堆的地方，連個修車工具都找不到......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"（我們也不至於在這裡耽擱時間！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們也不至於在這裡耽擱時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道你們那些鐵皮玩意還會中途出故障？真靠不住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那邊那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"別東張西望，就是喊你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就是你，你不是那個什麼商人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對，對，我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"有能治傷的玩意嗎，給我來一點，要那種見效快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要什麼，我和你交換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......商品是需要拿錢買的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩......之前來的商人明明都同意用東西交換了，怎麼這次就不行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不是被你們拿拳頭威脅的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你別插話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"真不能交換？我還有不少好東西，要是能換我就帶你去我住的地方拿，那裡是我們阿卡胡拉最熱鬧的地方了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這位客人確實能拿出好東西，這以物易物自然也是可以商量的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"還真行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這做生意嘛，當然要靈活些，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們現在就出發？這個阿卡......阿卡霍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，阿卡胡拉，這阿卡胡拉最熱鬧的地方，我可要見識見識，說不定能多談成兩筆生意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，肯定沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，真就不打了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"他們這是往哪走呢？那方向平常也沒啥人去啊，要幹啥，打獵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道......哎沒打架可看了，走，咱們去看看那個紅頭髮的外頭人把“叢林七號”拼好了沒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"快走快走，依娜姆這兩天不在，我要把之前送來的那個大玩意拆開好好看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"還、還沒到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟緊點，這裡野獸多，萬一走丟了，我可不保證你的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不是說已經快要到最熱鬧的地方了嗎，怎麼還有野獸出沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼稀奇的，我們提亞卡烏戰士，當然要住在野獸出沒的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"能獨自出入雨林，擊倒最兇猛的野獸，才是合格的戰士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那還真是了不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞧你剛才也是空手和那個菲林打架，這裡的戰士都是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。其他人有用長矛的，對付野獸的時候方便，但我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，戰士有拳頭就夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你這麼厲害，確實用不上那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我剛剛聽那個菲林話裡的意思，應該是他們的載具出故障了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你是和他們一起從外頭回到這裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......這你都聽出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這個，湊巧聽到而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你剛剛通用語說得不錯，我猜應該是在薩爾貢外頭學的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"聽了就聽了，你緊張什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"前段時間，有幾個外頭的人跑來我們這，說是能帶我們出去賺大錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！所以你就跟著去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"放屁！我看起來很無聊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是因為他們中間有不少看起來很強的高手，我才會跟著他們走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"結果這些人成天派我保護一些就知道待在鐵皮盒子裡的窩囊廢，我才不幹！外頭人就是奇怪，明明又菜又膽小，還整天瞎指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也沒要什麼工錢，直接回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"本來那幾個捎我一程的傻大個早該走了，就因為非要說那個大鐵皮盒子壞了，才磨蹭到現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道他們那個大鐵皮破爛要怎麼修！還有那麼多奇形怪狀的金屬玩意，見都沒見過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你們這也不像是有修理器材的樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你說啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我是說，載具可不好修理，要費一番功夫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不知各位阿卡胡拉的戰士，有沒有考慮過弄些更方便的工具？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，呃，那個菲林的載具，或者是能自動幫忙幹活的機器什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"要那些幹啥？我敢打賭，那些花裡胡哨的金屬玩意挨不了我一拳頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是奇怪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼奇怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，我是在外頭聽說了阿卡胡拉這片地方的傳聞，才決定要到這來碰碰運氣，看看能不能做成什麼買賣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"可現在看來......倒是沒什麼機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？外頭都說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是提亞卡烏戰士的威名——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，和這個無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說這片雨林裡住的部族又大又繁華，還掌握了不少機械技術，最近還開始對外通商......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"今天一看，好像這消息不太準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在下結論還太早，呵呵，我們做商人的，就是得要有耐心，細心，回頭還是把這附近都轉轉才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"沒準真能找到傳言裡那樣的大部族呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這話是什麼意思，難道你懷疑我騙你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這是哪裡的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，別動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"到我身後找個地方躲好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"快點，別磨蹭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"——有個大傢伙來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，沒事了，出來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然真的能獨自一人打倒這麼一大群猛獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這不算什麼，我不是說了？能擊倒最兇猛的野獸，才是合格的戰士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這一群的量太多，要不然還能更輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好謝的，本來就是我把你帶進雨林的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......你剛剛還說不保證我的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，趕緊處理處理你的傷口，等會，我找找藥，還有繃帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，都給你，算是剛剛護衛的報酬，就不收你錢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼不行的，拿去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你們這確實，和外頭說的不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那些小道消息，現在看來都是些不實的傳言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說都是不實傳言了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？難道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的部族又大又繁華這點千真萬確！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"部族裡外出狩獵的隊伍，最多的時候能有四五十人呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！你怎麼忽然站都站不穩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事，就是走了太久，有點腿軟......我們還沒到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，就在前頭不遠，很快就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"保證讓你看個夠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼收穫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你臉怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"別提了，哎，遇上個腦子裡長肌肉的野蠻人，非說要進村子，就得先和他們的勇士較量，直接把我給打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊村子又小又破，人也不多，就連修載具的工具都沒見過，白跑一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你那裡發現什麼沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。我往另一邊走了一段，有個紅髮的沃爾珀在修他的載具，還非要說等修好了載我兜風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟著轉了一圈，也就幾間破房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那人似乎有意不讓我太過深入，或許有什麼古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......我認為是外面傳言不實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼肯定？我說，你沒忘記帕夏吩咐我們過來的目的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"當然沒忘。但現在結果顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"至少目前看起來，這裡根本沒有什麼發展中的勢力可言，也沒什麼油水可撈，那個被安排在這的信使沒騙我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些風言風語......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是覺得哪裡有點不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你也說了，是風言風語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的信使......資料上說是叫依娜姆吧，她本來就喜歡搞些買賣，被傳得誇張些也還算正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"況且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"若是這裡沒能達到那些等著接管領地的王酋大人的期待，我們卻上報了，你我都不會有好下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對，料那些只想著比誰拳頭大的野蠻人，也不至於能騙過你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被捲入的行商？","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，儘快趕回都城，給帕夏一個交代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"都解決了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你那邊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"那些自動機械和車床都集中拉到附近的岩洞裡藏好了，沒被人看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"部落裡的其他人也都又叮囑了一遍，在外來人面前絕對不能提起機械的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了。現在我們只需要等著依娜姆她們回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙就留了封信，自己跑得沒影，嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你臉上的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，下回在訓練場讓你揍回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我，賈維更擅長演這種戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，對方不止一個人，我拜託賈維去拖住另一個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我們也可以選擇不打這一場，不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，不過我一時手癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"下回在訓練場讓我揍回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，開玩笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一來，那邊的人才更容易相信我們這些野蠻人腦子裡只有拳頭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶那傢伙去了早就棄之不用，只有外出的戰士偶爾歇腳的舊村落，他竟然也沒怎麼懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不一定完全沒懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他不能確定就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"只要讓對方摸不透底，拿不準主意，他們就暫時不會向上彙報......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也是嘍囉，會避開有風險的選項。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說得沒錯！況且還有小爺我出手，肯定沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀累死我了，自己把載具拆了再修太累人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，當時只想到這個藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要賠償的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"犯不著，小事一樁！這事我們以前騙......做買賣的時候常幹，不信你問布洛卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"等會，哈哈哈哈哈布洛卡你的臉哈哈哈哈哈笑死小爺了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。好了，說正經的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這回把人打發回去，應該就能撐一段時間，現在依娜姆還有祖瑪瑪、嘉維爾她們都不在，也只能暫時先這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"那些傢伙不會就這麼算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是。要是他們有這麼好解決，依娜姆就不會特地讓我過來守著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我會讓我們部族的人盯好雨林外圍，如果還有人來，再想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到啊，這裡的頭頭，那個叫依娜姆的，還挺信任你的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你整天跟在煌後頭，和這邊出身的那幾個人都不太親近，還以為你這次不會和她們一樣收到信就急衝衝跑回來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實和部族裡聯絡不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"恰好前段時間去了趟哥倫比亞，依娜姆聯繫我，讓我帶一批報廢車床回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這次的事......也不知道她為什麼會相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"那些都是你帶回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"挑得不錯，修好還能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"還能為什麼，估計看你長進了。這是好事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這次跟著你們一起來，還想著關鍵時刻能幫忙出出主意，結果現在看來，根本不需要小爺出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"原本看你經常和布洛卡幹架，還以為你會是那種直接衝上去，把人都揍翻的傢伙呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是完全沒揍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉變了太多，部族裡那些奇形怪狀的......機械，真不知道他們是怎麼想得出做得出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以為祖瑪瑪做的那些玩意就已經很怪了，但那些東西好歹形狀還算正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是覺得挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"實用就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒也是，至少有了這些機械，日子變得好過多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼好說話？現在你們可是生產種植打獵全方位開始用這些機械了，你那套提亞卡烏戰士拳頭論，估計也撐不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，你完全不在乎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，賈維！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我就好奇隨便問問！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"從我拋下族人離開這裡開始，我就沒有再干涉部族發展的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是提亞卡烏人自己做出的選擇，那就一定沒問題，我搞不明白這些機械，但我信這的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我自己在羅德島這段時間，也不是完全沒有反思過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是萬事都能簡單地把敵人揍翻了事，我就沒那麼煩心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"之前有一次......呃，我作為護衛，陪同博士和一家公司商談，對面派人要給我們下馬威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"我一不小心，就把人全打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......這種事有時候處理起來是挺麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"博士怎麼沒攔著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"攔了。我趁著博士睡著，出門打的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。等會，我好像聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是就是你說，想讓博士能多休息一會，結果愣是守著門，把一早過來找碴的人全打了那回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"別提了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那次差點就沒談成，最後還是靠博士補救，反而害博士休息得更少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......總之，那次給大家都添了不少麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"還好是博士在，博士沒怪你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒沒有。回羅德島之後博士還和我說，其實拳頭大就有道理這話沒說錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"但那得真的足夠大才行......至少我們現在還沒這個本事，所以遇事就得想想其他辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賈維","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"有、有道理......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有沒有，聽到什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，終於上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別感慨了，我們得快做準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這裡怎麼堆著這麼多機械？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，克瑪爾，真高興能見到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表情，嗯，至少不像是有壞事的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燧石","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實不算是壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，看來你已經把那些人都打發走了？我就覺得交給你一定沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"之後還有不少事要請你幫忙，不過目前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"先麻煩各位幫我們一起收拾一片村莊出來吧，我們阿卡胡拉，很快就有一大群來自地底的客人光臨了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["賈維"]},{"speakerId":"char_356_broca","aliases":["布洛卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["燧石"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
